{
  "label": "dormwar14",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label dormwar14:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage1.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello and welcome to the newly refurbished Amamiya family dojo!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And a big thank you to everyone who did not follow Sensei to the date competition!",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I hope it went horribly and that he never wants to talk to either of them ever again.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This room is much different without the Emerald Guardian screaming about her father.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have no idea what that means!",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage2.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We had our Halloween party here last year and Molly...got really drunk and let her Irish come out.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Last year? But haven’t you guys only been in class together for-",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So how is this supposed to go exactly?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage3.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The lighting is interesting, but it’s not like this is particularly scary.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The contest hasn’t even started yet, you friggin’ nerd.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not a-",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maya, the way it’s going to work is that you’re going to go in through the door on the left and Tsuneyo is going to go in through the door on the right.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Behind each door is a personalized room meant to scare the pants off of both of you.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whoever lasts the longest in there without coming out will be the winner.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s just one room?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. I wanted to do more, but I spent my entire allowance on putting up new walls.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sooooo we’re going to have to settle for just one room this year.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But that is fine! Because if your friends know anything about you, it will be a super scary room!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hopefully!",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am already scared.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage4.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsunecchi, aren’t you payin’ attention? The scary stuff hasn’t started yet.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not secretly a scaredy cat, are you?",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have never heard of that breed before.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It means that you’re easily frightened, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. Then no. I do not think I am that type of cat.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am just further away from Noodles than I have ever been before.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You really like ramen, huh?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles is my child.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You really like ramen, huh?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage5.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles is the bird on top of our vending machine. Tsuneyo spends a lot of time with him when she’s not busy workin’ or hangin’ out with Molly.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure your bird is okay, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If only his father never left. Perhaps I would feel safer.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I'm assuming the “father” is who I think it is, isn’t it?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I shall win this competition and ask him to come home and reunite our family.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage6.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, if it’s only one room, how will we know when it’s safe to come out?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean that there’s only so much you can see in one room.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unless it’s like...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A really big room?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right. Unless it’s a really big room.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I should have asked the Emerald Guardian to cast a warding spell on me.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Beats me. I guess we’re just hoping that one of them is scary enough to force you guys out right away.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And if you find yourself looking at everything and not getting scared, just...wait until we knock, I guess?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Feel free to come out whenever you want, Maya. One more win for the second floor girls could very well be all we need to end things.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oooooor stay inside as long as possible so we can get Sensei in our room for the beach.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. Stay inside even if there is someone threatening to kill you.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That wouldn’t even be a test of courage anymore. It would be a test of survival.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A test of survival...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So we are walking the plank...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Only if Molly put a plank in your room, Tsunecchi.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s the one that decorated yours, so if anything in there really does scare you, blame her and not us.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage7.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And no lawsuits if you get too scared!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": By entering the scary room, you waive all of your personal freedoms and agree that you bear full responsibility for anything and everything that happens inside.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I swear, if there is actually someone in there who is going to try and kill me, I am going to be very mad.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I, Tsuneyo Tojo, Noodle Evil Kendo Princess and Samurai of the Old Realm, Defender of All That is Delicious-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, Tsunecchi’s title got really long all of a sudden.",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I shall destroy fear as I destroy green onions.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m innocent! Don’t shoot!",
      "spk": "Uta",
      "spkColor": "#EF61BF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you ready, Maya?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was the one who decorated your scary room. So, even if I got everything right and you're totally terrified, try to hold out so we can win. Okay?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. Let’s just get this over with so poor Sana can calm down already.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage8.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...I’m gonna go talk to her in a couple minutes. She seems really nervous.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nervous? Me? Of course not. I am a warrior. A champion.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We're talking about Sana, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good luck.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You too, bro.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Bro?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Two girls in a line in a room made of lines approach a collection of lines and push them open.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Other things happen while this happens.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Here are some of them.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage9.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, as much as I want to win, I will understand if you don’t want to follow through with this.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No one in the class would want to stand up there in front of everybody for the sake of being judged.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, if you’re feelin’ nervous, none of us would hold it against ya. We care more about you bein’ happy than we care about sleepin’ in a room with our teacher.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d feel...really bad...backing out after...Ami and Ayane spent so much of last night making the outfit for me...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami...didn’t even sleep...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She went home after the rap battle and...did her best...so...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have to...show everyone how hard she worked...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage10.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m just...worried that...Y...Yasu will...win instead...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You kiddin’? That creepy girl over you?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s really kind of you, Sana. Following through with this for the sake of everyone else even though you don’t want to.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But really. If it gets to be too much...just give me a signal, okay?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m your captain, so it’s my job to make sure you’re feeling fine at all times.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah! You can count on Makoto!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, everybody knows Sensei likes ‘em tiny! And you’re the tiniest thing we’ve got!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage11.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei likes what, Miku?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothin’! I didn’t say anything!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Go Sana! Yeah! You got this!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mmmmmmm.........",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage12.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can hear the sound of your blood.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage13.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Futaba?!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I kinda need you over here!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin...Rokuhara...",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Such a pretty name.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene testofcourage14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/testofcourage14.webp",
      "alt": "testofcourage14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...th...thank you?...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How long have you been hurting?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Excuse me?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your body.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can see through the fibers.",
